      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want to \"learn\" from it. there's nothing left to learn from. the investment is gone. i put two decades into this and it's just a zero. i feel like i've been playing a game for 20 years where the rules were rigged and now i'm just sitting there with nothing to show for it. it just seems so pointless to keep playing.",
